00:21:56.896 --> 00:21:58.780
to answer in the comments,
because I know you love

00:21:58.780 --> 00:22:00.745
reading, Peter reads all your comments.

00:22:00.745 --> 00:22:01.810
He always wants to jump in.

00:22:01.810 --> 00:22:03.698
He like razzes me, he's
like, "You know, Sally

00:22:03.698 --> 00:22:05.171
"said you stink."

00:22:05.171 --> 00:22:08.184
So, he's paying attention boys and girls.

00:22:08.184 --> 00:22:13.165
- One thing I learned over
my entire career in academia

00:22:13.165 --> 00:22:17.305
as well as in business,
especially relative to start up

00:22:17.305 --> 00:22:22.301
businesses, one to three
year old businesses, working

00:22:22.301 --> 00:22:27.338
on big brands at big
companies etc., was at the end

00:22:27.338 --> 00:22:32.379
of the day, it came down to
two or three words that I would

00:22:32.379 --> 00:22:37.509
always ask when anyone
brought in an idea or a new

00:22:37.509 --> 00:22:42.666
ad campaign, new product,
new consumer promotion

00:22:42.666 --> 00:22:46.810
idea, a new opportunity
within a company, small,

00:22:46.810 --> 00:22:51.153
medium or large, it came
down to two or three words,

00:22:51.153 --> 00:22:54.024
and if they could answer
the question in these two

00:22:54.024 --> 00:22:57.375
or three words, that went
together by the way, and I'll

00:22:57.375 --> 00:22:59.666
tell you right now, the
middle word was and, so you'll

00:22:59.666 --> 00:23:03.648
need two more, what would
be your two words that you

00:23:03.648 --> 00:23:05.945
think every successful business

00:23:05.945 --> 00:23:07.999
needs to be able to address?

00:23:07.999 --> 00:23:09.434
- Blank and blank.

00:23:09.434 --> 00:23:10.990
I like it, we'll see what you have to say.

00:23:10.990 --> 00:23:12.256
- Yea, but the answer is not blank.

00:23:12.256 --> 00:23:14.143
- Got it, Peter, I love you.

00:23:14.143 --> 00:23:14.881
- Cheers.

00:23:14.881 --> 00:23:15.851
- Give me kiss.

00:23:15.851 --> 00:23:20.284
You keep asking questions,
we'll keep answering them.

00:23:20.284 --> 00:23:25.284
(upbeat music)

